# Dart: Dart Programming Language Specification (Dart 3) and the language tour; requirements/languages/dart.md
name     dart

keyword  abstract as assert async await base break case catch class const continue covariant default
keyword  deferred do else enum export extends extension external factory final finally for hide if
keyword  implements import in interface is late library mixin new on operator part required rethrow
keyword  return sealed show static super switch sync this throw try typedef var when while with yield
type     int double num String bool List Map Set Iterable Future Stream dynamic void Object Never Null
type     Function Record
builtin  true false null print

ident-extra    $
line-comment   //
block-comment  /* */  : nested
string   ''' '''  : escapes multiline interp=dollar
string   """ """  : escapes multiline interp=dollar
string   ' '      : escapes interp=dollar
string   " "      : escapes interp=dollar
prefix   r        : literal
escape        : x=2 u4 u-braces
operators  +-*/%&|^!<>=:?~
calls
decorators
